  "description": "A dispute between the Trade Federation and the outlying systems of the Republic has led to a blockade of planet Naboo, prompting the Galactic Senate into action. They secretly dispatch Jedi Master Qui-Gon Jinn and his Padawan, Obi-Wan Kenobi as ambassadors, hoping to resolve this issue with Viceroy Nute Gunray. But unknown to the Jedi, Gunray's Trade Federation is in league with the mysterious Darth Sidious, Dark Lord of the Sith, who orders Gunray to reinforce the blockade with a full-scale invasion of Naboo. After eluding a death trap and fighting their way through scores of battle droids, Qui-Gon and Obi-Wan manage to escape and find their way to the endangered planet's surface..."
